%% Sequence Diagram - Parent-Youth Account Management (Mermaid)
sequenceDiagram
    participant Parent as Parent
    participant WebApp as Banking Web App
    participant API as Youth Account API
    participant Auth as OAuth Server
    participant AccountSvc as Account Service
    participant PaymentSvc as Payment Service
    participant TxnSvc as Transaction Ledger
    participant DB as Youth Account DB
    Note over Parent,WebApp: All API calls require OAuth2 (RBAC enforced)
    Parent->>WebApp: Login & obtain OAuth2 token
    WebApp->>Auth: Validate credentials
    Auth-->>WebApp: OAuth2 token (scoped)
    WebApp->>API: GET /api/youth-accounts/{id}/dashboard
    API->>Auth: Validate token
    Auth-->>API: OK
    API->>AccountSvc: Get account info
    API->>DB: Get spending limit
    API->>TxnSvc: Get recent transactions
    API-->>WebApp: Dashboard response (balance, limit, transactions)
    WebApp-->>Parent: Show dashboard
    Note over Parent,WebApp: Fund Transfer
    Parent->>WebApp: Initiate fund transfer
    WebApp->>API: POST /api/youth-accounts/{id}/fund-transfer
    API->>Auth: Validate token
    Auth-->>API: OK
    API->>PaymentSvc: Transfer funds
    PaymentSvc-->>API: Transfer status
    API->>DB: Update balance
    API-->>WebApp: Transfer response
    WebApp-->>Parent: Show transfer result
    Note over Parent,WebApp: Set Spending Limit
    Parent->>WebApp: Set weekly limit
    WebApp->>API: PUT /api/youth-accounts/{id}/spending-limit
    API->>Auth: Validate token
    Auth-->>API: OK
    API->>DB: Update spending limit
    API-->>WebApp: Limit update response
    WebApp-->>Parent: Show limit update
    Note over Parent,WebApp: View Transactions
    Parent->>WebApp: View transactions
    WebApp->>API: GET /api/youth-accounts/{id}/transactions?startDate=&endDate=
    API->>Auth: Validate token
    Auth-->>API: OK
    API->>TxnSvc: Get transaction history
    API-->>WebApp: Transaction list
    WebApp-->>Parent: Show transactions
    Note over API,DB: All actions logged for audit (ADR/SDLC compliance)
